WEBVTT

00:14.013 --> 00:16.095
Ilya. You

00:22.680 --> 00:26.744
should be a cult. Everything should be

00:26.844 --> 00:29.286
eradicated. You should be a cult, Ilya.

00:50.425 --> 00:57.649
Seven hours of silence Seven hours of her voice A

00:57.689 --> 01:03.552
list of rules and warnings I didn't have a choice

01:04.733 --> 01:08.795
The mountains rolling past the glass A world

01:08.935 --> 01:14.498
I'll never know I'm just a passenger, I'm

01:14.598 --> 01:22.181
trapped With nowhere else to go I don't know.

01:49.387 --> 01:50.467
I'm bent

01:58.810 --> 02:03.232
She's watching me, I feel her eyes She thinks I'm

02:03.372 --> 02:08.594
going to fail This trap she set, this college

02:08.734 --> 02:14.883
test A cage outside the jail The road is long, my

02:15.043 --> 02:20.987
hands are cold I wish that I could hide This car's

02:21.047 --> 02:26.191
a cell, this angry hum With her right here inside

02:31.573 --> 02:37.956
Route 460 rolling west A knot of panic in my chest

02:38.536 --> 02:43.438
The engine is a pounding drum From everything

02:43.718 --> 02:49.500
I've overcome Or everything I'm running to I

02:49.580 --> 02:54.502
don't know what I'm going to do A silly college

02:54.682 --> 02:58.684
experiment I'll break before I'm bent

03:01.622 --> 03:02.863
I'm not ready.

03:05.224 --> 03:06.485
I'm not ready.

03:08.926 --> 03:13.449
She's right. I'll fail. I'm not ready.

03:29.380 --> 03:35.744
Route 460 rolling wet A knot of panic in my chest

03:36.305 --> 03:41.208
The engine is a pounding drum From everything

03:41.448 --> 03:47.252
I've overcome Or everything I'm running to I

03:47.312 --> 03:51.514
don't know what I'm going to do This silly

